    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n10808" root="خصل" body-key="x">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِخْصَلٌ</span></b>  A <i>very sharp</i> sword (JK, S, K) &amp;c.:
(M:) a dial. var. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِقْصَلٌ</span>. (S.) <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِخْضَلٌ</span> is said
by A 'Obeyd to be a mistranscription for <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِخْصَلٌ</span>;
but AHei and others authorise it. (TA.)

